oss) for the period                 -328,006  -233,034          \n                                                                                  \n         Other comprehensive income                                               \n         Items that may be reclassified to profit or loss                         \n         Translation differences of foreign operations 134,373   -12,603          \n                                                                                  \n         Other comprehensive income for the period                                \n                                                       134,373   -12,603          \n         Total comprehensive income for the period    -193,632  -245,637          \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                              Because every communication matters. 33\n</excerpt_1>\n\n<excerpt_2>\nFinancial statements 2020     \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n          Consolidated  statement  of cash flows                                  \n          for the period ended 31 December                                        \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n          (Amounts in 