	query: Extract sections containing revenue and gross profit figures, income statements, notes on revenue and cost of sales, accounting policies, pro forma/adjusted reconciliations, consolidation scope, currency/presentation, restatements or subsequent events in the provided prospectus and annual report. Provide page/section references and numeric values with units for revenue and gross profit for each reported period.
	k: 5

