t or loss in -                \n                                             -       -                            \n        subsequent periods                                                        \n        Other comprehensive income for the period 327 015 (80 469) (12 603)       \n        Total comprehensive income for the period 82 318 (157 613) (245 637)      \n                                                                                  \n        *unaudited                                                                \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                                                                  \n                                    